{"game": "back-4-blood", "language": "english", "appid": 924970, "month": "2024-06", "window": 4, "start_date": 1719187200, "end_date": 1719791999, "month_true_total": 617, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 20:52:08 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "168643970", "author": {"steamid": "76561199074891213", "personaname": "Jota", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/jota-deack/", "num_games_owned": 327, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 19061, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 17431, "last_played": 1779471151, "avatar": "54820048a96b4dc3040aeaff25a334fc8052f2cb"}, "language": "english", "review": "I have to say that this game is amazing. Being so different from l4d makes it unique. The number of possibilities depends on each cleaner's abilities, cards combination, and corruption cards, making each game feel unique.\nI love how challenging it feels and how it helps improve aim.\nDefinitely always this game encourages me to back 4 blood.", "timestamp_created": 1719786796, "timestamp_updated": 1742772963, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 10, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.62073063850402832", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "168643735", "author": {"steamid": "76561198084053203", "personaname": "Justgettingby", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/zRainbowz/", "num_games_owned": 66, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 6358, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5507, "last_played": 1743289419, "avatar": "4625ace2f2fa70ae90380eaf2e151832b4526980"}, "language": "english", "review": "eventho there are some elements that are lacked of compare to l4d but it is still a really good game with a build system. i would reco